ekUnited #StarTrek #BLM","media":null,"username":"hipcinema","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":23.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":189,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":29,"sumOfClimate":4,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":23.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1273236785489993729","date":1592398279000,"rawContent":"@NotNikyatu We are literally seen as \"The Mules of the World\"-- from Zora Neale Hurston's THERE EYES WERE WATCHING GOD.\n#BlackWomen #BLKWomxn #BLM","media":null,"username":"hipcinema","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":24.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":190,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":29,"sumOfClimate":4,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":24.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1273238155248963584","date":1592398606000,"rawContent":"Dear @tribelaw:\nWAKE UP!\nSincerely,\nEvery #BIPOC in America\n\nDear @nytopinion:\nWAKE UP! You need more #BIPOC to write for you.\nSincerely,\nEvery #BIPOC Intellectual in America\n\n#BLM","media":null,"username":"hipcinema","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":25.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":191,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":29,"sumOfClimate":4,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":25.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1273255092691578883","date":1592402644000,"rawContent":"@emilybest There is a real need for cultural literacy in America. Most White Editors may not have the cultural competencies to work on projects that deal with race. Experience matters. Context matters. We need diverse editing teams #HireBLKWm #RepresentationMatters #NoMoreTokens #BLM","media":nul