tructive in so many ways. But mostly it is the White Silence that leads to economic\/career death of #BIPOC. White people see diversity as shades of beige, not colors in the rainbow. Do better White people. Be better. @lfsorguk @DirectedbyWomen #BLM","media":null,"username":"hipcinema","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":29.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":195,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":29,"sumOfClimate":4,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":29.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1273458174096441344","date":1592451063000,"rawContent":"#StarTrekUnited #StarTrek #MichelleYeoh #BLM","media":null,"username":"hipcinema","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":30.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":196,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":29,"sumOfClimate":4,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":30.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1273462608977432577","date":1592452120000,"rawContent":"#StarTrekUnitedGives #StarTrekUnited #StarTrek #BLM \nI hope that @startrekcbs opens up it's staff to more #BIPOC and #BlackWomen crew and writers. #Uhura was the promise that has not been kept by the franchise. We can help you tell her story. https:\/\/t.co\/CvJqukufiS","media":[{"thumbnailUrl":"https:\/\/pbs.twimg.com\/tweet_video_thumb\/Eaw_fI1WsAYr0xN.jpg","variants":["https:\/\/video.twimg.com\/tweet_video\/Eaw_fI1WsAYr0xN.mp4"]}],"username":"hipcinema","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":31.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":197,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":29,"sumOfClimate":4,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":31.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id